	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Type `hd` in Alfred to list every agent running in the Herdr app. Blocked agents come first, then
working, done and idle; sub-agents are listed under their parent. Type to narrow the list; all
words must match.

Press &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; to jump to the chosen agent: Herdr comes to the front, selects the agent's
space and tab and focuses its pane. An agent with no pane, such as a parked sub-agent, opens as a
peek instead.

The list refreshes once a second while it is open.</string>
